# -- Second bottle-refill point per floor (2026-08-27) ---------------------
# The building has TWO drinking-water / bottle-refill points on every floor;
# only one per floor was modelled. Rooms are REAL rooms from the building's own
# metadata, chosen deterministically: a common area, atrium or kitchen where the
# floor has one, never a plant room, goods store or comms room. The exact
# placement within the floor is simulated and says so -- the floor and the count
# are the facts stated by the building's owner.

<http://abacwsbuilding.cardiff.ac.uk/abacws#Amenity_DrinkingWater_Floor0_b>
    a ontosage:Amenity , ontosage:DrinkingWater ;
